iv class=\"line\">her teachers.</div>\n    <div class=\"answers\">\n      <span class=\"a\">A. respected</span>\n      <span class=\"b\">B. respectable</span>\n      <span class=\"c\">C. respectful</span>\n      <span class=\"d\">D. respecting</span>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section>\n    <div class=\"line\">67. In that school, English is compulsory for all students, but French and Russian are</div>\n    <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"blank w34\"></span>.</div>\n    <div class=\"answers\">\n      <span class=\"a\">A. special</span>\n      <span class=\"b\">B. regional</span>\n      <span class=\"c\">C. optional</span>\n      <span class=\"d\">D. original</span>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section>\n    <div class=\"line\">68. Tom and Mary’s house bought last year is <span class=\"blank w38\"></span> Lucy’s.</div>\n    <div class=\"answers two-column\">\n      <span class=\"a\">A. the three size of</span>\n      <span class=\"b\">B. three times the size of</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"answers two-column\">\n      <span class=\"a\">C. as three times large as</span>\n      <span class=\"b\">D. three times as larger as</span>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section>\n    <div class=\"line\">69. We don’t believe the young man is <span class=\"blank w32\"></span> of finishing such a difficult task.</div>\n    <div class=\"answers\">\n      <span class=\"a\">A. competent</span>\n      <span class=\"b\">B. capable</span>\n      <span class=\"c\">C. qualified</span>\n      <span class=\"d\">D. Clever</span>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section>\n    <div class=\"line\">70. I’m <span class=\"blank w36\"></span> awake, but she is <span class=\"blank w32\"></span> asleep.</div>\n    <div class=\"answers\">\n      <span class=\"a\">A. very; very</span>\n      <span class=\"b\">B. very; much</span>\n      <span class=\"c\">C. much; well</span>\n      <span class=\"d\">D. wide; fast</span>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section>\n    <div class=\"line\">7