n class=\"a\">A. competitively</span>\n      <span class=\"b\">B. recently</span>\n      <span class=\"c\">C. reasonably</span>\n      <span class=\"d\">D. highly</span>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section>\n    <div class=\"line\">76. Mona always enjoyed skiing but she doesn’t do it <span class=\"blank w32\"></span>.</div>\n    <div class=\"answers\">\n      <span class=\"a\">A. yet</span>\n      <span class=\"b\">B. already</span>\n      <span class=\"c\">C. any more</span>\n      <span class=\"d\">D. any longer</span>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>"
